# steps/table-receiver.md §8: unit_s7_part_free_bound under the knob --walk-methods: peek, a method of the
# part unit_s7_part_free_bound_part.lm2, walked, reads its free name k from its caller m -- 9, not the
# source's field k, 5.  Entry 7.
size_t: k 5U
fn: m () size_t
    size_t: k 9U
    size_t: r 0U
    r: peek()
    return: r
size_t: got 0U
got: m()
int: ok 0
if: got = 9U
    ok: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
